+// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
+// Fused in-graph all-reduce for CPU NUMA devices.
+//
+// Instead of returning to the main thread at every tensor-parallel boundary (one dispatch
+// round trip + an OpenMP region start per subgraph, ~157-400 times per token), each device
