+// LLM_GRAPH_TYPE_DECODER_MTP draft head for GLM-5.3-Flash (glm5next).
+//
+// Semantics mirror the deepseek/GLM-DSA NextN layer:
+//   enorm(embed) + hnorm(prev_hidden) -> concat(e, h) -> eh_proj ->
+//   one decoder block (DSA/MLA attention + sigmoid-gated MoE with shared expert)
